SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The ssttrrffmmoonn() function conforms to IEEE Std 1003.1-2001 (“POSIX.1”).  The
     ssttrrffmmoonn__ll() function conforms to IEEE Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”).

